Source: https://github.com/catppuccin/yazi/blob/d62802be39210ea10e54b3e3b09735c6cb9e57c1/themes/mocha/catppuccin-mocha-mauve.toml
License source: https://github.com/catppuccin/yazi/blob/d62802be39210ea10e54b3e3b09735c6cb9e57c1/LICENSE

Bundled without changes. The catalog selects the upstream Mauve accent. Only style tables are merged at apply time; layout glyphs, icons and file rules are not imported. The preview path is redirected to the bundled official catppuccin/bat theme (see yazi-catppuccin-mocha-syntax.LICENSE). Existing flavor selectors are cleared so they cannot override this directly configured theme.

